:: Scavenging - look for - holding out
<h1 class="ptitle">OUTSIDE</h1>
<br /><br />
<<set _npc = $guests[$scavengingDidntReturn]>>
<!-- #### places/outside/scavenging_holding_out.jpg | a capable armed survivor sitting on a broken wall of a ruined building in a post-apocalyptic wasteland at dawn, a makeshift barricade of debris behind them, a bag full of scavenged goods at their feet, weapon resting across their knees, tired but unhurt, dust and smoke in the air, cinematic, realistic --ar 4:2 --p -->
<center>
	<<if _npc.gender == 1>>
		<<image 'places/outside/scavenging_alive_male.jpg' 'sfw'>>
	<<else>>
		<<image 'places/outside/scavenging_walk_girl.webp' 'sfw'>>
	<</if>>
</center>
<br /><br />
After a few hours you found fresh tracks and a thin line of smoke rising from the ruins of an old building. Broken furniture and scrap had been dragged across the doorway into a barricade.
<br /><br />
Behind it sat <strong><<=setup.displayName(_npc)>></strong>, tired and covered in dust, but unhurt. A bag full of salvage lay at <<=setup.pronounceWhos(_npc)>> feet, and <<=setup.pronounceWhat(_npc)>> was keeping a close eye on the street.
<br /><br />
<<sayNpc _npc>>
	Raiders came through last night. I couldn't outrun them with all this, so I dug in and waited them out. They lost interest after I put one of them down.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />
<<=ucfirst(setup.pronounceWhat(_npc))>> grinned when <<=setup.pronounceWhat(_npc)>> saw you, clearly proud of having held <<=setup.pronounceWhos(_npc)>> ground. Together you carried the salvage back home.
<br /><br />
<<set _holdItem = either(setup.items.scavenging)>>
<<set _holdCount = random(2, 4)>>
<<run setup.cabinInventory.pickup(_holdItem, _holdCount)>>
<<set _npc.relationship = Math.min((_npc.relationship ?? 0) + 5, 100)>>
<<set _npc.happy = Math.min((_npc.happy ?? 0) + 10, 100)>>
<<set _holdEndurance = setup.fight.gainEndurance(_npc, setup.fight.JOB_ENDURANCE_CAP)>>
<strong>You got <<=_holdCount>> <<=Item.get(_holdItem).name>></strong>
<br />
<strong><<=_npc.name>> relationship increased by 5</strong>
<<if _holdEndurance>>
	<br />
	<strong><<=_npc.name>> endurance increased by 1</strong>
<</if>>
<br /><br />
<<set _linkHome = 'Take ' + setup.pronounceWho(_npc) + ' home'>>
<<link _linkHome>>
	<<goto 'Outside'>>
<</link>>
